**/transcripts/

# Stage-specific local media and generated artifacts. These rules only affect
# Git; editor and Remotion watcher exclusions are configured separately.
**/01-原始素材/**
**/02-转录与剪辑决策/转录缓存/**
**/03-精剪输出/代理片段/**
**/06-预览与审核/**
**/07-成片/**

# The public video package contains Skills and workflow only. Personal projects,
# source media, renders, local caches, and old local migrations stay on this Mac.
/视频项目/
/旧版项目/
/本地项目/
/动效库/
/memory/reference/参考分析缓存/
/临时输出/
/迁移清单.md

# Third-party checkouts and Codex-managed plugin caches are restored from
# dependencies.json instead of being copied into the public repository.
/skills/video-use/
/skills/video-use.backup-*/
/插件Skills快照/
/插件运行时入口/
